ffset constrained, literals-only). Unresolved epistemic gaps: complete encoder byte output sequence during put_integer(1,9,0) including all normalize calls within put_bit operations, whether put_bit calls during unary bit_len encoding trigger additional normalizes that output duplicate bytes, exact encoder put_bit behavior during unary encoding to match decoder's consumption of 20 unary zeros. The fundamental protocol incompatibility between encoder normalize byte output timing and decoder normalize byte consumption timing prevents any compressed stream from decompressing successfully."}
